                                "example_id": "c2ba0b1f-3cb8-47ca-8dfa-36f43ed17e7c",
                                "sense_id": "8486ad54-095f-3835-924a-bf744023b7cc",
                                "text": "These noble warriors, mindefull to pursew / The last daies purpose of their vowed fight, / Them selves thereto preparde in order dew […]."
                            }
                        ]
